<title>BRAZIL: Brazil orange juice industry reports weekly output.</title>
<headline>Brazil orange juice industry reports weekly output.</headline>
<dateline>RIO DE JANEIRO 1997-05-21</dateline>
<text>
<p>The Brazilian Association of Citrus Exporters reported the following output and exports of frozen concentrated orange juice in metric tonnes 66 Brix for the period May 12-18 and the total so far in 1996/97.</p>
<p>		 May 12-18   May 13-19	  TOTAL	  TOTAL</p>
<p>		 1996/97	1995/96	 1996/97	1995/96</p>
<p> Stocks/open  244,444.5   261,899.7</p>
<p> Production	     0	     0   1,089,679.4    973,306.9</p>
<p> Shipment	22,820.2    13,891.2   1,022,913.2    862,700.4</p>
<p> Home Market	259.9	 252.5	14,849.6     16,900.6</p>
<p> Stocks/close 221,364.4   247,756.0</p>
<p>((-Caroline Bulloch, Rio de Janeiro newsroom, 5521 5074151))</p>
